#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:1
msgid "Adding a Cloud Provider"
msgstr "新增云厂商"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:3
msgid ""
"`tensorcircuit.cloud` exposes quantum hardware through one set of APIs "
"(`submit_task`, `get_task`, `Task.results`, ...) in `apis.py`. Each "
"provider is a module implementing a fixed set of functions, and `apis.py`"
" dispatches to it by name. Anything specific to a provider belongs in its"
" module, rather than in branches on provider names in the generic layer. "
"Files below are in `tensorcircuit/cloud/` unless a path is given."
msgstr ""
"`tensorcircuit.cloud` 在 `apis.py` 中通过一套 "
"API（`submit_task`、`get_task`、`Task.results` "
"等）暴露量子硬件。每个厂商都是一个实现固定函数集合的模块，`apis.py` "
"按名称分发到它。任何厂商特有的内容都应放在其模块中，而不是在通用层里按厂商名分支。除非给出路径，下面的文件都位于 "
"`tensorcircuit/cloud/`。"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:5
msgid ""
"Existing providers are good references: `tencent.py` (batch submission, "
"qubit remapping by the provider), `tianyan.py` (vendor SDK), and "
"`lqcloud.py` (vendor SDK, local compilation to native gates, the request "
"body as sent kept in `task.prepared`)."
msgstr ""
"现有厂商是很好的参考：`tencent.py`（批量提交，由厂商进行量子比特重映射）、`tianyan.py`（厂商 SDK）和 "
"`lqcloud.py`（厂商 SDK，在本地编译为原生门，实际发送的请求体保存在 `task.prepared` 中）。"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:7
msgid "Registration"
msgstr "注册"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:9
msgid ""
"Add the module, e.g. `myprovider.py`, and register it in "
"`_provider_modules` in `apis.py` together with the vendor SDK modules it "
"needs, whose versions the task store records. Modules are imported on "
"first use, so a missing vendor SDK only fails when the provider is used."
msgstr ""
"添加模块，例如 `myprovider.py`，并在 `apis.py` 的 `_provider_modules` "
"中注册它，同时注册它所需的厂商 SDK 模块，任务存储会记录这些 SDK 的版本。模块在首次使用时才导入，因此缺少厂商 SDK "
"只会在使用该厂商时失败。"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:10
msgid ""
"Import the vendor SDK inside a helper, raising an `ImportError` with the "
"install command, since vendor SDKs are not dependencies of TensorCircuit."
" Pin the tested version in `requirements/requirements-extra.txt` for CI, "
"without adding a `pyproject.toml` extra."
msgstr ""
"在辅助函数内部导入厂商 SDK，并在导入失败时抛出带有安装命令的 `ImportError`，因为厂商 SDK 不是 TensorCircuit "
"的依赖。在 `requirements/requirements-extra.txt` 中固定经过测试的版本以供 CI 使用，不要在 "
"`pyproject.toml` 中添加 extra。"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:11
msgid "Put the default service URL in `config.py`."
msgstr "把默认服务 URL 放在 `config.py` 中。"

#: ../../source/cloud_provider.md:12
msgid ""
"Regenerate the API docs with `docs/source/generate_rst.py` instead of "
"editing `.rst` files, and add a CHANGELOG entry."
msgstr ""
"使用 `docs/source/generate_rst.py` 重新生成 API 文档，而不是直接编辑 `.rst` 文件，并添加 "
"CHANGELOG 条目。"

